[{"title":"寒雨浃旬终不成雪","author":"曾几","text":"幽栖又三冬，好雪无一片。\n今晨霭同云，薄暮集微霰。\n先声乃如许，落势大可见。\n呼儿出门看，通夕知几遍。\n听窗复听竹，攲枕不知倦。\n终然成底事，寒雨闭深院。\n何尝忧瘠田，初不办欢宴。\n囊萤已乾死，无以映书卷。\n请天收层阴，斗柄行欲转。\n爱日上晴轩，如披故人面。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77292,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寓居有招客者戏成","author":"曾几","text":"蓬蒿小院立秋天，秃鬓凄风雨飒然。\n丈室何人问摩诘，后堂无地著彭宣。\n床头白酒新浮瓮，案上黄诗屡绝编。\n不厌寒家淡生活，书窗期与子周旋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77293,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游张公洞","author":"曾几","text":"张公洞府未著脚，向人浪说游荆溪。\n欲看直上翠羽盖，不惜扶下青云梯。\n劲风翻动土囊口，暗水流出桃花蹊。\n却将深处问儿辈，一夕飞梦穷攀跻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77294,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游灵川县水洞","author":"曾几","text":"清溪东南驰，碍此碧玉峰。\n蛟龙夜相宅，奋迅生雷风。\n剨开两贝阙，凿翠成珠宫。\n坐令空洞处，一水油然通。\n泉流百道来，投注万斛钟。\n不知深几许，湛若镕青铜。\n定应天下稀，岂但湘南雄。\n嘉与二三子，叶舟渺相从。\n周旋乳盖底，荡漾菱花中。\n为我告行客，无为苦匆匆。\n小酌清泠渊，洗汝尘坌胸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77295,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游桥南竹园","author":"曾几","text":"杖屦桥南访此君，别君安否断知闻。\n苦遭积雨来为祟，政得新晴为解纷。\n直干万馀森碧玉，高标一半入青云。\n人言岁暮于吾子，踏雪相看未当勤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77296,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"湖州张公济仰高亭","author":"曾几","text":"苕溪霅溪磨青铜，南山北山无数峰。\n不知当用几钱买，罗列乃在君窗中。\n属官属私置莫问，但办一榻眠清风。\n烟波钓徒定乃祖，傥有渔舟吾请从。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77297,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溆浦县邓梦授主簿惜日轩","author":"曾几","text":"羲和鞭白驹，秋日凄已短。\n向来晒书地，欲作炙背暖。\n邓侯开西轩，枣下歌纂纂。\n前山隐半规，怅望支手版。\n我慵类天赋，身世两不管。\n著鞭惭祖生，运甓谢陶侃。\n铜壶一百刻，夜梦分去半。\n午窗又为祟，长闭读书眼。\n勉旃崇明德，已事不可缓。\n作诗非为君，实自警疏懒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77298,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"溆浦楠木洞盖神龙所居今年夏大旱县官乞取其水以祷立应民犹以为未足因作是诗以遗诸公致再请之意焉","author":"曾几","text":"倾心南山云，如渴望梅岭。\n朝来有佳思，拄笏不见顶。\n丰隆骏奔走，列缺元驰骋。\n雨不到人间，风伯乃为梗。\n生来食官仓，四海无二顷。\n歌诗视天汉，一念极耿耿。\n阶前甃清泉，洮颒冰雪冷。\n乾喉欲生烟，空下百尺绠。\n幽轩竹三四，柯叶殊秀整。\n迩来头抢地，但惧不得永。\n以斯占稻粱，生意鱼在鼎。\n潜虬民司命，膏泽浸兹境。\n邑官树嘉政，责报甚形影。\n瓶罂走十里，岂惮一再请。\n君其洁斋俟，百谷正延颈。\n客子无远谋，空肠望遗秉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77299,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"禽声","author":"曾几","text":"不如归去东皋上，美酒提壶迎妇饷。\n何妨脱裤著新衣，百箔蚕丝茧如盎。\n春泥滑滑未没腰，田间布谷初立苗。\n牧儿喜舞麦熟也，报答尔曹婆饼焦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77300,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"董令升舍人朋溪图赵祖文笔也","author":"曾几","text":"谷风不须歌，朋友道缺绝。\n请歌伐木诗，歌罢听吾说。\n汉朝儒宗系，今代侍臣杰。\n甘泉久论思，阳羡小休歇。\n郊园谷幽幽，乔木覆清樾。\n百禽鸣其间，相唤极可悦。\n坐令公感慨，朋好苦难结。\n不如侣荆溪，迥与世情别。\n淡乎若无味，了不见凉热。\n是以乐从之，诸峰况罗列。\n赵侯有能事，短纸藏曲折。\n更作陶渊明，飘飖弄明月。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77301,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢柳全叔县丞寄高丽松花","author":"曾几","text":"幽人所住空山里，老松皆作虬龙起。\n但知树底听松风，不见风前落松子。\n三韩华萼手自开，其间琐碎如婴孩。\n请因贾客诏君长，二十馀年无使来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77302,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"谢胡帅饷酥","author":"曾几","text":"虎头骨相生来无，谈天吻燥斋肠枯。\n欲从底处觅膏润，凝香燕寝烹牛酥。\n鹅儿黄拂冰肌肤，关中穰下远不如。\n已令炊饼作十字，今晨盛馔非伊蒲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77303,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"道中遇雨","author":"曾几","text":"客子祈晴意未公，林间布谷劝春农。\n雨师若有分风手，留取车轮一道通。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77304,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遗直堂 其一","author":"曾几","text":"三孔吾渭阳，犹及见仲叔。\n堂堂舍人公，再拜但乔木。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77305,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遗直堂 其四","author":"曾几","text":"老柏蜀人爱，甘棠召南思。\n领客清樾下，作诗咏歌之。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77306,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遗直堂 其五","author":"曾几","text":"元祐几阅岁，诸公一无遗。\n吾舅典型在，神明力扶持。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77307,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遗直堂 其三","author":"曾几","text":"策登董相科，赋作长卿语。\n刘牢出外甥，愧我不如古。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77308,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"遗直堂 其二","author":"曾几","text":"长身一庭中，劲气九霄上。\n思公立朝时，凛凛不可向。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77309,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"碧芦潨","author":"曾几","text":"春风桃李蹊，学语鸟相唤。\n不可无寒芦，汀洲下凫雁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77310,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"肇庆守郑子礼以李北海石室碑见寄辄次山谷老人韵为谢","author":"曾几","text":"吾评古法书，固自有高下。\n端州遗我石室碑，一字千金恐非价。\n莫邪之剑难争锋，李公落笔神气同。\n诗鸣一代属山谷，草根亦复吟秋虫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77311,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"墨坳","author":"曾几","text":"有水碧于天，玄云滃然起。\n定是临池人，一沐管城子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77312,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"横碧轩","author":"曾几","text":"道山心已灰，但有爱山癖。\n移家过溪住，政为数峰碧。\n空濛梅子雨，了不见颜色。\n朝来忽献状，欣若对佳客。\n晴窗卷书坐，葱翠长在侧。\n似为神所怜，持用慰岑寂。\n会登此山头，却望水南北。\n烟树有无间，吾庐应可识。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77313,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉石","author":"曾几","text":"冷石磨青瑶，客至相与饮。\n醉倒不用扶，真成一高枕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77314,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题东皋","author":"曾几","text":"市声俱不闻，野色良可喜。\n听公北宅住，还我东皋子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77315,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题寿樟亭","author":"曾几","text":"大屋连甍小容足，栋宇以来非一木。\n豫章不是十围樗，受命于天何得独。\n君莫厌老大蓬蒿间，应龙虹梁果非福。\n虚堂昼静闻丁丁，溜雨枯皮在空谷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77316,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题张彦实舍人墓下涌泉亭","author":"曾几","text":"紫薇花底人，去作泉下梦。\n佳城闭青春，风木号永痛。\n寒泓孰出之，甘冽可抱瓮。\n乃知主地神，效此清净供。\n汲引入中厨，色味胜乳湩。\n老龙来试诗，事有万钧重。\n寄声松大夫，并语石翁仲。\n俱修护持职，以遗云来用。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77317,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题临川宰徐伯章心远轩","author":"曾几","text":"徐侯心万里，身堕百里中。\n政以诗礼庭，上有鹤发翁。\n岂无敲榜喧，不入丘壑胸。\n开轩寄远韵，几净窗玲珑。\n竹影落夏簟，水光摇秋空。\n一对凫鹜行，万里牛马风。\n悠然见南山，不与俗眼同。\n徐侯归去来，三径资已丰。\n身将心共远，勿为督邮恭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77318,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题南岳铨德观秋声轩","author":"曾几","text":"月明雁叫远，露下蝉号寒。\n幽幽草虫泣，索索梧叶乾。\n愁人知秋早，听此良独难。\n竹君南北美，佩服青琅玕。\n天风一披拂，庭宇声珊珊。\n灵宫荫老樾，别馆如深山。\n心净鉴止水，眼明揖千竿。\n虚籁自然奏，有琴不须弹。\n世议大可厌，市声无少闲。\n不如听君语，竟日帘垂间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77319,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题退轩","author":"曾几","text":"求名恐颠隮，求道戒进取。\n谁知却行人，可以超万古。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77320,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题盛彦光少府丘壑轩","author":"曾几","text":"何许觅丘壑，不专在山林。\n胸次傥萧散，市朝有幽寻。\n只今谢幼舆，超然抱遐心。\n俯仰得佳趣，何尝日登临。\n我虽非夔旷，粗亦能赏音。\n不用一再鼓，山高水深深。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77321,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题黄嗣深家所蓄惠崇秋晚画","author":"曾几","text":"丛芦受风低，积潦得霜浅。\n沙匀洲渚净，水澹凫鸭远。\n禅扉掩昼夜，短纸开秋晚。\n欲问此间诗，半山呼不返。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77322,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题程伯禹给事漫吾亭","author":"曾几","text":"漫郎专一溪，万事俱不理。\n胡为堕我相，名字出奇诡。\n山林轩冕欤，等是寄焉耳。\n程公榜亭意，道眼深照此。\n端居亦偶然，小出聊复尔。\n宣城幻事了，却梦归故里。\n结庐澄潭上，尽室清镜里。\n木阴凉夏簟，荷气馥秋水。\n遥岑招不来，为我列窗几。\n昔吾与今吾，念念如脱屣。\n心期次山外，人要安石起。\n公勿赋远游，行应去天咫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77323,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题摘蔬亭","author":"曾几","text":"幽畦小雨馀，一一锦绣段。\n春日细春盘，悬知咄嗟办。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77324,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠空上人","author":"曾几","text":"我搴空门秀，得之古疏山。\n斯人器玉壶，中有宝月寒。\n四壁澹相对，安身一蒲团。\n玲珑六窗静，竟日心猿闲。\n时从禅那起，游戏于笔端。\n当其参寻时，恣意云水间。\n松风漱齿颊，萝月入肺肝。\n政使不学诗，已见诗一斑。\n况复用心苦，俗氛何由干。\n今晨出数篇，秀色若可餐。\n清妍梅著雪，圆美珠走盘。\n乃知心镜中，万象纷往还。\n皆吾所现物，摹写初不难。\n谁能效我辈，造语出险艰。\n请师剩汲古，净洗蔬肠酸。\n坐令韩退之，收敛加巾冠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77325,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠赵判官寿卿二首 其二","author":"曾几","text":"得州敢为荣，得士乃足诧。\n此郎精琴书，不独妙诗画。\n虽云于小道，举不在人下。\n无乃太不廉，谁知非讥骂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77326,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠赵判官寿卿二首 其一","author":"曾几","text":"身为高帝孙，面作寒士气。\n缘情德麟语，写物大年意。\n青云无苏黄，何以致后世。\n窗明几静间，是事且游戏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77327,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠阎德夫参议","author":"曾几","text":"阎公才气人无敌，列星官曹声藉藉。\n青云垂上却回头，笑说乡邦富泉石。\n问君功业男儿事，禹重寸阴轻尺璧。\n及身强健不勉旃，汲汲东皋恐非策。\n答云种木须十年，种得成阴已头白。\n是以江滨五亩园，拄杖芒鞋日经画。\n即今台榭数十处，花竹谁能计千百。\n是中便足了一生，颇觉轩裳总无益。\n我闻此语为惊叹，耆境之间真迫窄。\n元无三径可就荒，乃知贫过陶彭泽。\n想君舒啸东皋上，不但渊明心莫逆。\n神交又得王无功，一饭何尝留俗客。\n未妨献纳云台表，著绣昼行寻履迹。\n会当称是好林塘，门对诸峰一区宅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77328,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"赠疏山清老","author":"曾几","text":"江西草堂清，道价直寰宇。\n中分死心坐，亲饮晦堂乳。\n与人作阴凉，雨后散烦暑。\n千林摇落后，郁郁松柏古。\n厖头覆霜雪，碧眼照针缕。\n贯穿禅家流，领略我辈语。\n居山专论道，馀事百不睹。\n人言师疏慢，我但见媚妩。\n去年潇湘来，丛席历几所。\n踞堂号知识，说法若云雨。\n阴求乃翁事，未见一人举。\n请师长住世，此道要盟主。\n杖拂有馀闲，时时入州府。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77329,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"羃翠庭","author":"曾几","text":"群木上参天，清阴并为一。\n炎曦无路来，不废风月入。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77330,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"㔶瓮酒","author":"曾几","text":"吴侬饼曲成村酒，所取何尝议升斗。\n一杯未尽朱颜酡，过若茅柴那得久。\n官酤私酿同一律，竟识吾家新酝否。\n近持方法报山妻，入眼从来未曾有。\n旧时菽麦真其父，秫稻麦和以为母。\n瓮头又戴老瓦盆，墐塞四旁如户牖。\n数朝已办糟床注，不论清浊皆可口。\n欣然一笑谓山妻，慎勿轻传殆天授。\n答云妙处须心得，纵有此方无此手。\n请君痛饮当解酲，贤哉大胜刘伶妇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77331,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"广南韩公圭舶使致龙涎香三种数珠一串戏赠 其一","author":"曾几","text":"千里传闻陆凯，一枝远寄梅花。\n虎节无烦驿使，龙涎走送寒家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77332,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"广南韩公圭舶使致龙涎香三种数珠一串戏赠 其二","author":"曾几","text":"花气薰肌郁郁，贯珠入手累累。\n想见范公和处，绝胜乃祖偷时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77333,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李商叟秀才求斋名于王元渤以养源名之求诗 其二","author":"曾几","text":"老杜诗家初祖，涪翁句法曹溪。\n尚论渊源师友，他时派列江西。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77334,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李商叟秀才求斋名于王元渤以养源名之求诗 其三","author":"曾几","text":"学问直须富有，文章政要深藏。\n玉在山中辉润，兰生林下芬芳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77335,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"李商叟秀才求斋名于王元渤以养源名之求诗 其一","author":"曾几","text":"自古词林枝叶，皆从根柢中来。\n万卷须窥藏室，一尘莫点灵台。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77336,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"荔子六言","author":"曾几","text":"蕉叶定成哙伍，梅花应愧卢前。\n金谷危楼魂断，白州旧井名传。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77337,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄嗣深尚书见访","author":"曾几","text":"骑气初占客至，履声忽报公来。\n不乱空庭鸟雀，何妨满席尘埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77338,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄嗣深尚书自仰山来惠茶及竹薰炉","author":"曾几","text":"茗椀中超舌界，薰炉上悟香尘。\n坐我集云峰顶，对公小释迦身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77339,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"落梅","author":"曾几","text":"玉颊香肌委尘土，雪魄冰魂无处所。\n一年春事顿成空，不必飘零似红雨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77340,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"曾几","text":"僧居负高青，佛阁俯深翠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77341,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"曾几","text":"地灵得南徐，天险称此固。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77342,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十一","author":"曾几","text":"断崖韦偃树，小雨郭熙山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77343,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其五","author":"曾几","text":"新如月出初三夜，清似茶烹第一泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77344,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其六","author":"曾几","text":"一天倒影澄秋色，万顷波浮浸月华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77345,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十四","author":"曾几","text":"红皱解罗襦处，清香开玉肌时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77346,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其七","author":"曾几","text":"手自栽培千个竹，身常枕籍一床书。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77347,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其九","author":"曾几","text":"不堪相背处，何况独归时。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77348,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十","author":"曾几","text":"摸金千骑去，埋玉几人归。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77349,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十五","author":"曾几","text":"猩血染罗欣入手，冰肌饮露欲濡唇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77350,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"曾几","text":"斫雪流膏乃如许，也容石蟹趁时新。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77351,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十三","author":"曾几","text":"可惜不当梅蕊破，幽香合在弟兄间。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77352,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"曾几","text":"使君领客未经旬，更以蝤蛑作小春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77353,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其十二","author":"曾几","text":"借我以一鉴，饷公无两瓻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77354,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"携茶访杨东山","author":"曾三异","text":"搴衣不待履霜回，到得如今亦乐哉。\n泓颖有时供戏剧，轩裳无用任尘埃。\n眉头犹自怀千恨，兴到何如酒一杯。\n知道华山方睡觉，打门聊伴茗奴来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77355,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉梁观","author":"曾三聘","text":"道人抱道常避人，闭门三月不识春。\n风风雨雨不相识，起迎北斗生精神。\n夜来梦揖梅子真，脱胎换骨隔一尘。\n玉池生液银河润，咽?自有元和津。\n山中且住不须去，九仙岭上云迷路。\n捣馀药裹卧松根，只在丁当鸟鸣树。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77356,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宣州水西作","author":"曾纡","text":"杖藜出郭一水近，石蹬古路穿松筠。\n万仞绝壑倚天末，八节惊滩当寺门。\n泉声飞下锦绣谷，殿影插入玻璃盆。\n宣州水西天下胜，阆州城南何足云。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":77357,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]